<title>UK: Morland full year profits up 34 percent.</title>
<headline>Morland full year profits up 34 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>	    (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)	     38.8		    vs 35.7</p>
<p> Total divd (pence)    12.75		   vs 11.70</p>
<p>Pretax		    14.37		   vs 10.69</p>
<p> Turnover		  83.4		    vs 62.56</p>
<p> Operating profit	16.7		    vs 13.4</p>
<p> Interest		  2.459		   vs 2.385</p>
<p> Tax			 3.625		   vs 3.189</p>
<p> Pay date		  Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration date Dec 17</p>
<p> Ex-div date	     Dec 9</p>
<p>NOTE - Company said it opened seven new retail pubs in the year and its sales of Old Speckled Hen beer were up by 13.6 percent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
